{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03348",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.59,
      "end_seconds": 4.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.15,
      "end_seconds": 9.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.05,
      "end_seconds": 17.77,
      "duration_seconds": 6.72,
      "text": "Honestly, it's vomiting once or twice, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.78,
      "end_seconds": 26.87,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.41,
      "end_seconds": 31.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "It's been three days, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.11,
      "end_seconds": 38.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.95,
      "end_seconds": 48.36,
      "duration_seconds": 9.41,
      "text": "It happens every other day. I'd call it severe. Only sips of fluid, and it's not much."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.38,
      "end_seconds": 52.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.92,
      "end_seconds": 60.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get loose stools as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.8,
      "end_seconds": 66.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.33,
      "end_seconds": 72.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.72,
      "end_seconds": 93.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Alright, did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.07,
      "end_seconds": 99.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "I had part of my thyroid removed years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.94,
      "end_seconds": 115.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.95,
      "end_seconds": 129.11,
      "duration_seconds": 12.16,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. I walk the dog every morning. I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.78,
      "end_seconds": 133.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.16,
      "end_seconds": 138.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.93,
      "end_seconds": 150.05,
      "duration_seconds": 10.12,
      "text": "Yes, high blood pressure is known to us, good to have that clear. Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.9,
      "end_seconds": 153.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.56,
      "end_seconds": 155.26,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.12,
      "end_seconds": 163.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "It's oral rehydration solution, 1 sachet, after each loose stool."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.35,
      "end_seconds": 170.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "Have you noticed no wet nappies, drowsiness or high fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.0,
      "end_seconds": 174.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.39,
      "end_seconds": 178.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Ah. Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.06,
      "end_seconds": 181.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.69,
      "end_seconds": 198.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.78,
      "end_seconds": 208.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.82,
      "end_seconds": 227.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.53,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 113 over 70, temperature 36.5. And respiratory rate 14, pulse 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.73,
      "end_seconds": 230.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.19,
      "end_seconds": 236.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.11,
      "end_seconds": 240.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.99,
      "end_seconds": 244.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.06,
      "end_seconds": 258.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "He is alert, drinking, with moist lips and a soft tummy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.73,
      "end_seconds": 267.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.72,
      "end_seconds": 280.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. This is probably a mild stomach bug."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.23,
      "end_seconds": 285.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.6,
      "end_seconds": 304.46,
      "duration_seconds": 17.86,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a mild stomach bug, and we'll watch how it goes. Just to be sure I understood. You've had vomiting once or twice for three days, severe, and no drowsiness or high fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.32,
      "end_seconds": 308.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "That's it, uh, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.08,
      "end_seconds": 324.38,
      "duration_seconds": 15.3,
      "text": "Small, frequent sips of fluid and keep him off nursery for two days after it stops. Come back or go to emergency straight away if he stops drinking or becomes drowsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.91,
      "end_seconds": 332.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Okay, I'll look out for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.69,
      "end_seconds": 343.4,
      "duration_seconds": 9.71,
      "text": "Let's plan a check if he is not drinking. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.99,
      "end_seconds": 347.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.05,
      "end_seconds": 354.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}